Package: libva-v4l2
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libva2 (>= 2.23.0)
Description: VA-API driver for Linux V4L2
 Provides VA-API decoding through the Linux V4L2 Request API, encoding
 and video processing through memory-to-memory interfaces, and LINEAR
 DRM PRIME buffer sharing. Available operations are discovered at runtime.
 See the support matrix for implemented codecs, formats and limitations.
